  Use MPI non-blocking operations: OFF
  Gewald manually set to:          0.35
  Slab volfactor manually set to:    3
neighbor        2.0 bin
neigh_modify    every 1 delay 0 check yes
# per-molecule constraints
fix             chg fq qeq/sam 1 0.0 10.0 1.0e-8 param
fix_modify      chg shield gaussian
samqeq: lr-solve shielding = PQEq Gaussian erf(a_ij r)/r (param 4th col = Rc (Gaussian radius)); routed through compute_H + add_fixed_charge_field + the legacy gas path (calc_Hval)
fix_modify      chg energy yes
fix_modify      chg gself on width 0.50 types 1
samqeq: gself RESTRICTED to type(s) 1 -- the self-energy is a lattice regulariser (metal sites, where eta is a bulk TF quantity with no width in it) and a DOUBLE COUNT on molecular sites, whose eta was fit to the IP/EA of a finite-width atom
samqeq: gself ON -- finite-width charge self-energy K_e*sqrt(2a/pi) ADDED to the on-site diagonal (width 0.500 A for the listed type(s) only); folded into eta from eta0 at init()
velocity        water create 298.0 4928459 mom yes rot yes dist gaussian
fix             rig water rigid/nvt/small custom i_body temp 298.0 298.0 0.1
